    dash_to(1, goal)
move_towards( goal )
let camp2 = first( filter( camps, in_attack_range() ) )
if exists(camp2):
    attack(camp2)
set_priority( 1 + random_int(100) )
end_turn()

# v2: parent tune-1 (v1). One change: bigger tribute bags. A carrier now walks to an altar only with
# 15+ gems (was 10), so each trip carries more and fewer trips are exposed to camps and enemies.
# Hurt carriers (<50% health) and late game (after round 1500) still tribute at any bag size, so
# the retreat and endgame behaviour is unchanged. Draft, casting and camp logic are v1 unchanged.
# tune-1 [line: tune]: draft order vendetta, vesper_vale, tavi, ryth, ren.
# v7zg-cast [hybrid line]: v7-zerogem + ability-type-aware casting (shield/heal on self, dash for escape and
# far camp goals, damage/aoe/stun/reset at the target).
# v7-zerogem: no fighting enemies on their own spawn, fight a camp that is the only way to an altar, and go
# for monoliths when nothing is tributed by round 300.
# v7: idle fix: on a dead camp of an uncleared group, walk to the nearest living camp.
